Name: specialuse_extra
Type: STRING
Default-Value: NULL
Last-Modified: 2.5.0

Whitespace separated list of extra special-use attributes that can be set
on a mailbox, in addition to the built-in ``\Archive``, ``\Drafts``,
``\Junk``, ``\Sent``, ``\Trash``, ``\Important``, ``\Snoozed`` and
``\Scheduled``.  The :rfc:`6154` attributes ``\All`` and ``\Flagged`` are
not built in.
